{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2020-04-30 18:30:00', 'title': 'Qualcomm Sees Q3 GAAP Diluted EPS Between $0.29 To $0.49', 'text': "QUALCOMM EARNINGS RELEASE AVAILABLE ON COMPANY'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE.QTRLY GAAP EPS $0.41, NON-GAAP EPS $0.88.QTRLY REVENUES $5,216 MILLION VERSUS $4,982 MILLION.GAAP RESULTS WERE ALSO NEGATIVELY IMPACTED BY $265 MILLION, OR $0.21 PER SHARE, IN NON-MARKETABLE INVESTMENT IMPAIRMENTS,.QTRLY REVENUES $5,216 MILLION VERSUS $4,982 MILLION.SEES Q3 MSM CHIP SHIPMENTS 125 MILLION - 145 MILLION.SEES Q3 QTL REVENUES $750 MILLION - $950 MILLION.SEES Q3 REVENUE BETWEEN $4.4 BILLION TO $5.2 BILLION.QUALCOMM - GUIDANCE FOR Q3 IS BASED ON PLANNING ASSUMPTION THAT THERE WILL BE ABOUT 30% REDUCTION IN HANDSET SHIPMENTS RELATIVE TO CO'S  PRIOR EXPECTATIONS.GUIDANCE FOR REVENUES AND EPS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2020 EXCLUDES QTL REVENUES FROM HUAWEI.ESTIMATED IMPACT OF GREATER THAN $0.30 TO EPS IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2020..SEES Q3 GAAP DILUTED EPS BETWEEN $0.29 TO $0.49.SEES Q3 NON-GAAP DILUTED EPS BETWEEN $0.60 TO $0.80.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.78, REVENUE VIEW $5.02 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q3 REVENUE VIEW $4.89 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.76 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA."}
